# Agents (LangGraph)

- Graph nodes: Supervisor/Router → Intake → Matchmaker → Verification.
- Keep `AgentState` typed (TypedDict); pass only needed fields between nodes.
- Tools call MCP servers / services — do not embed vision/blur/SQL inside agent prompts.
- Route intents: `report_intake` | `match_refresh` | `claim_verify` only for MVP.
- Fail soft: circuit-breaker / fallback via `llm_provider`; never crash the graph on one LLM error.
- Do not add voice, CRM ticket, or RAG-chat agents (out of MVP).
